## Cheatcodes Reference

### State Manipulation
```solidity
vm.prank(alice);           // Next call from alice
vm.startPrank(alice);      // All calls from alice until stopPrank
vm.stopPrank();

vm.deal(alice, 100 ether); // Set ETH balance
deal(address(token), alice, 1000e18);  // Set token balance

vm.warp(block.timestamp + 1 days);   // Set block.timestamp
vm.roll(block.number + 100);          // Set block.number

vm.store(target, slot, value);  // Write storage
vm.load(target, slot);          // Read storage
```

