## CI/CD Integration

```yaml
# .github/workflows/test.yml
name: Tests
on: [push, pull_request]

jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3
        with:
          submodules: recursive
          
      - uses: foundry-rs/foundry-toolchain@v1
      
      - run: forge build
      - run: forge test -vvv
      
      - run: forge coverage --report lcov
```
